    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got back from a super long flight from singapore to ny (like 14 hours lol) and i feel kinda weird. my calf on the right side is really hurting and sharp, and i'm having a hard time catching my breath. is this just like travel fatigue or maybe i'm just dehydrated? i'm pretty exhausted",
