      "content": "idk i'm just so drained and the thought of going to an er right now sounds like a nightmare. i'm sure it's just a cramp from the flight. if i take some ibuprofen or maybe an aspirin it'll help with the inflammation right? and i'll just keep my leg up and try to sleep. that's fine, right? it'll be better in the morning.",
